flowchart TD
    A[Client Request] --> B[Query Resolver]
    B --> C{Pagination Enabled?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Execute Query With Pagination]
    C -->|No| G[Execute SQL Query]
    D --> F[Generate Final SQL Query]
    F --> G
    G --> H[(Database)]
    H --> I[Retrieve Results]
    I --> J[Return Response]